  "tinai": "unknown",
  "sangamTamil": "பரவா, வெளிப்படா, பல்லோர்கண் தங்கா\nஉரவோர்கண் காமநோய் ஓஓ.\nகொடிதே. விரவாருள் நாணுப் படல்அஞ்சி யாதும்\nஉரையாதுஉள் ஆறி விடும்.",
  "urai": null,
  "english": "The passions of virtuous men are under control. The disease of lust in men mighty (in wisdom) gains not ascendancy, is not revealed, does not remain fixed on many objects. O! it is a cruel conflict; but fearing to incur shame in the midst of their foes, they say nothing about it, and it is extinguished within them.",
